{
  "background_and_question": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "attribution": "Justice O'Connor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "54d12418d20dc1b6b09319c2afcd4d4397b7e5203125fe2b1b5bb1f5c893a3c6",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-54d12418d20d-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 19,
              "start": 19
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice O'Connor, jUSTICE O'CONNOR: \u201cBut why isn\u2019t that always the case if it\u2019s time\u2011barred?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice O'Connor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "54d12418d20dc1b6b09319c2afcd4d4397b7e5203125fe2b1b5bb1f5c893a3c6",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-54d12418d20d-0001-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice O'Connor, jUSTICE O'CONNOR: \u201cWell, now, the Federal Government has a different proposed rule than yours. Are you going to comment on their proposal?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "54d12418d20dc1b6b09319c2afcd4d4397b7e5203125fe2b1b5bb1f5c893a3c6",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-54d12418d20d-0001-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 22,
              "start": 22
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "JUSTICE BREYER: \u201cBut the Government, by the way, seems a broader rule than yours. The only thing it rules out is new legal claims or new evidence. I don\u2019t see anything in your \u2026 tell me if I\u2019m wrong, but I don\u2019t see anywhere where you say we should be able to bring a 60(b) motion based on new legal claims or new evidence.\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "54d12418d20dc1b6b09319c2afcd4d4397b7e5203125fe2b1b5bb1f5c893a3c6",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-54d12418d20d-0001-0009"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 33,
              "start": 33
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Breyer, jUSTICE BREYER: \u201cSo is that also true if his own witness has committed the fraud?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "54d12418d20dc1b6b09319c2afcd4d4397b7e5203125fe2b1b5bb1f5c893a3c6",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-54d12418d20d-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 36,
              "start": 36
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Ginsburg, jUSTICE GINSBURG: \u201cDo we have that anyplace at \u2013 in the papers before us, the first \u2013 the first dismissal in the Florida \u2013 in the Florida trial court?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Stevens",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "54d12418d20dc1b6b09319c2afcd4d4397b7e5203125fe2b1b5bb1f5c893a3c6",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-54d12418d20d-0002-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 38,
              "start": 38
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Stevens, jUSTICE STEVENS: \u201cBut is it correct that they address the same subject matter? Isn\u2019t 60(b) directed at the integrity of the habeas proceeding, whereas AEDPA is directed at the integrity of the original conviction?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "54d12418d20dc1b6b09319c2afcd4d4397b7e5203125fe2b1b5bb1f5c893a3c6",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-54d12418d20d-0002-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 40,
              "start": 40
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Ginsburg, jUSTICE GINSBURG: \u201cDidn\u2019t Congress rule \u2013 rule out 60(b) in \u2013 in death cases?\u201d"
      }
    ],
